# React / TypeScript (staff bar)

Vite SPA in `services/web`. Functional components. Strict TS. No `any`. No AI comments.

- Shared `api` client (`credentials: "include"`). No ad-hoc `fetch` in pages.
- Colocate UI state in the page; extract a hook only when two screens share it (`useDebouncedValue`).
- Keys = SKU / order id, never array index. Lists render **text** (`{product.name}`), never `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`.
- Every screen: loading, empty, error, success. Disable **Buy** / **Upload** / **Add to cart** while in-flight.
- One `Idempotency-Key` per checkout attempt (`useRef` + `crypto.randomUUID()`). 409 stock → cart, do not clear lines.
- Quantity inputs: `min=1`, `max=stock`, clamp on input; visible copy **`N available`**. Stock 0 → disable add.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
await fetch("/api/checkout", { method: "POST", body: JSON.stringify({ total }) });

// ✅ GOOD
await api.post("/api/checkout", undefined, { idempotencyKey });
```

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: product.name }} />

// ✅ GOOD
<h2>{product.name}</h2>
```

No Next.js, Storybook, Redux, or a component library. React Router for `/`, `/products/:sku`, `/cart`, `/checkout`, `/orders`, `/login`, `/signup`, `/admin/**`.
